# Rockchip 官方 PREEMPT_RT 配置(源自 SDK docs/Patches/Real-Time-Performance
# kernel-6.1/kernel-6.1.99/0005),并做 Ubuntu 容器裁剪:
# 官方配置禁用了 CGROUP_SCHED/PSI 等,会破坏 cgroup v2 容器运行时
# (cpu 限额)与 ubuntu/scripts/check-kernel-config.sh 的断言;这些禁用项
# 已移除,RT 延迟相关禁用项保持官方原样。
# CONFIG_ARM_PSCI_CPUIDLE is not set
# CONFIG_ARM_ROCKCHIP_DMC_DEVFREQ is not set
# RT_GROUP_SCHED 是 Android 风格配置:cgroup v2 下各 cgroup 的 RT 预算
# 默认为 0,会以 EPERM 拒绝 SCHED_FIFO 准入(cyclictest 直接失败)。
# 工业 RT 产品默认关闭;需要按容器隔离 RT 任务时可再启用。
# CONFIG_RT_GROUP_SCHED is not set
# CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_TIMES is not set
# CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_THERMAL is not set
# CONFIG_DEBUG_SPINLOCK is not set
# CONFIG_IRQ_TIME_ACCOUNTING is not set
# CONFIG_MALI_BIFROST_ENABLE_TRACE is not set
# CONFIG_MALI_BIFROST_SYSTEM_TRACE is not set
# CONFIG_PROFILING is not set
# CONFIG_SCHED_DEBUG is not set
# CONFIG_SCHED_INFO is not set
# CONFIG_TASKSTATS is not set
# CONFIG_MIGRATION is not set
CONFIG_CPU_FREQ_DEFAULT_GOV_PERFORMANCE=y
CONFIG_JUMP_LABEL=y
CONFIG_HZ_PERIODIC=y
CONFIG_HZ_1000=y
CONFIG_PREEMPT_RT=y
